      en: ["Mbandaka is positioned almost exactly on the Equator line.", "The city was originally established as Coquilhatville in 1883.", "The park overlooks the Congo River, the world's deepest river.", "The nearby Eala Botanical Garden dates back to the year 1900.", "Mbandaka serves as a major transit point for northern river trade.", "The region receives approximately 1,600 mm of rain annually."],
