      en: ["Maize provides over 70% of the caloric intake for rural Congolese.", "Some regions can achieve up to three harvests within a single year.", "Maize flour is the key component of the staple dish known as 'fufu'.", "Average yields typically range between 1 and 2 tons per hectare.", "The Kasai and Katanga provinces lead the nation in maize production.", "Planting cycles are traditionally synchronized with the rainy seasons."],
